# The repository stores every text file with LF endings (it always has — every
# blob in history is LF), and checks them out as LF on every platform, including
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true. That keeps gofmt, prettier and svelte-check
# seeing the same bytes git has, so formatters do not flag whole files over line
# endings alone. Binary files are detected and left alone by text=auto.
* text=auto eol=lf
